\eqn{[0, 1]}), and its posterior is sampled by conjugacy and rejection.
The sensitivity parameters \eqn{\theta_A^{(0)}} and \eqn{\theta_N^{(1)}}
do not enter the likelihood, and are handled in one of two ways:
}
